/*
============================================================
 TELEOP CONTROL MAP
============================================================

====================================================
Gamepad 1 (Driver)
====================================================
Left Stick (Y-Axis): Forward / Backward movement
Left Stick (X-Axis): Strafe Left / Right movement
Right Stick (X-Axis): Robot Rotation / Turning only
A Button: Speed preset – Normal (0.95 speed factor)
B Button: Speed preset – Slow / Precision (0.40 speed factor)
X Button: Speed preset – Medium (0.70 speed factor)
Y Button: Speed preset – Turbo (1.25 speed factor)
Left Bumper (Hold): Auto-Align with AprilTag vision target (uses PD control to lock onto the goal)

===================================================
Gamepad 2 (Operator / Subsystems)
===================================================

Right Trigger (> 0.5): Start Intake & Transfer (intake = 1.0, sideServo = 1.0, frontServo moves to 0.22 [blocking nectar])
Left Trigger (> 0.5): Stop Intake / Transfer (intake = 0, sideServo = 0, frontServo returns to 0.18 [idle])
Right Bumper: Reverse Intake / Outtake (intake = -1.0, frontServo at 0.22)
Left Bumper (Press): Quick Eject Burst (briefly reverses intake to clear jams)
Y Button: Shoot / Feed (runs the cam-jet feed servo dynamically tuned using Limelight distance ballistics)
X Button: Stop Feed Servo
A Button: Flower Drop Bar (drops frontServo to 0.35 to get objects out of the flower)
Dpad Up: Trigger Auto-Shooter sequence
Dpad Left: Toggle Auto-Spin armed state
Dpad Right: Toggle Limelight Vision ON / OFF

------------------------------------------------------------
AUTOMATIC LOGIC
------------------------------------------------------------
 - Shooter only spins in AUTO mode if armed (D-Pad Right).
 - Servo feed (Y) works only when flywheel is at target velocity.
 - LED Status:
       Off (BLACK)  -> Vision disabled OR not in AUTO mode
       Red          -> AUTO mode: no or incorrect tag detected
       Yellow       -> AUTO mode: correct tag detected, not at speed / not armed
       Green        -> AUTO mode: correct tag detected, flywheel ready
       Flash Yellow -> Driver pressed Y too early
 - Alliance goal tag hardcoded via GOAL_TAG_ID (20 = blue, 24 = red)
 - Logging toggle via LOG_ENABLED boolean
============================================================
*/
